<section class="testimonial-area light-bg pt-115 pb-90">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="testimonial-wrapper-two">
            <div class="row no-gutters align-items-center">
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <img src="/webassets/images/elements/step-39.jpeg" alt="img" style="border: 4px solid red;">
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-6 ">
                    <div class="testimonial-content-box bg_cover wow fadeInRight justify-content-center align-items-center d-flex flex-column" style="background-image: url(&quot;/webassets/images/bg/testimonial-bg-3.jpg&quot;); visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInRight;">
                        <div class="section-title section-title-left pb-1">
                            <span class="sub-title">Submission Protocol</span>
                            <h5>
                                Your feline friend's well-being is our top priority.
                            </h5>

                        </div>

                        <p class="d-flex text-center"><i class="bi bi-check mr-2" style="font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 52, 79);"></i>To safeguard the health and welfare of felines, our platform mandates that only legitimate breeders who prioritize the well-being of their cats can list kittens or cats for adoption. This stringent policy requires each breeder to provide verifiable documentation before they can proceed with a listing.</p>

                        <p class=" d-flex text-center"><i class="bi bi-check mr-2" style="font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 52, 79);"></i>Specifically, breeders must submit a valid Breeder's License as proof of their commitment to ethical breeding practices. Additionally, for those operating within Spain, a Zoological Number is also required, underscoring our dedication to compliance with local regulations. This dual-layer verification process is our commitment to ensuring that every kitten or cat finds a home that is not just loving, but also responsible and informed.</p>

                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="testimonial-area pt-115 pb-90">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="testimonial-wrapper-two">
            <div class="row no-gutters align-items-center">
               
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <img src="/webassets/images/elements/step-22.png" alt="img" style="border: 4px solid red;">
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-6 ">
                    <div class="testimonial-content-box bg_cover wow fadeInRight justify-content-center align-items-center d-flex flex-column" style="visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInRight; padding: 10px 35px 10px 13px;">
                        <div class="section-title section-title-left pb-1">
                            <span class="sub-title mb-1">Approval Process</span>
                            <h5>
                                No Exceptions
                            </h5>

                        </div>

                        <p class="d-flex text-center"><i class="bi bi-check mr-2" style="font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 52, 79);"></i>At the core of our commitment to excellence, our dedicated team takes a hands-on approach to meticulously review each submission received. With a fine-tooth comb, we scrutinize every detail to verify the accuracy of the information presented, ensuring that it not only meets but exceeds our stringent standards. This rigorous process is not merely about fact-checking; it’s about guaranteeing that each piece aligns perfectly with regulatory and ethical compliance, safeguarding the integrity of our publication.</p>

                        <p class=" d-flex text-center"><i class="bi bi-check mr-2" style="font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 52, 79);"></i>Before any content graces our platform, it undergoes this thorough vetting process, a testament to our unwavering dedication to quality and reliability. This foundational principle ensures that our audience always has access to content that is not only engaging and informative but also trustworthy and above reproach.</p>

                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<!--====== End Next Section ======-->



